**Given**:

frac{{26}}{{21}} : frac{{24}}{9} ::k :frac{{14}}{{13}}

**Concept Used**: 

For any proportion a : b :: c : d

We know that a × d = b × c

**Calculation**: 

∴ frac{{26}}{{21}} : frac{{24}}{9} ::k :frac{{14}}{{13}}

⇒ frac{{24}}{9} times k = frac{{26}}{{21}} times frac{{14}}{{13}}

⇒ k = frac{{26}}{{21}} times frac{{14}}{{13}} times (9)/({24)}

⇒ *k *= 1/2
